# E.V.A. Frontend

Before editing, read `.cursor/skills/eva-frontend/SKILL.md`.
Platform specs: `.cursor/skills/eva-specs/SKILL.md`.

## Quick rules

- Features: `agents`, `skills`, `actions`, `tools`, `workspace`
- Overview validations: `agents/utils/validateAgent.ts`
- Action recipes use enabled Tools; FSM picks Action ids
- Paths from `router/paths.ts`

## Verify

```bash
cd frontend && npm run build
```
